{"id":542,"at":1791903923843,"t":"chat","from":"player","tag":"note","text":"Extra detail for #10 (GB flash after wild battle). Sequence in the contact sheet from the Rattata win: 'CHARMANDER gained 24 EXP. Points!' box stays about 2 s, then at about +3.0 s a full-screen grey/white GB-style frame shows, and at about +3.25 s it shows the GB Charmander stat box in the old GB font ('CHARMANDER Lv7 24/24'), before the overworld fades in at about +3.5 s. Also, the overworld stays heavily blurred/washed out for several seconds after the battle (screenshots at turns 18-21), so it may be a leftover transition overlay.","bug":10}
